{"seq":3,"slug":"rag-architecture","title":"RAG 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/rag-and-retrieval/rag-architecture","wordCount":819,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"rag-架构\">RAG 架构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>RAG 的演进本身就是一条清晰的概念线索，从最朴素的形态逐层加固：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>检索增强生成（RAG）</strong>：生成前先检索相关文档，为 LLM 提供外部知识，从而减少幻觉、让回答基于事实。</li>\n<li><strong>离线索引 / 在线查询</strong>：索引阶段分块→嵌入→入向量库；查询阶段检索→组装 Prompt→生成，两条流水线解耦。</li>\n<li><strong>Naive RAG</strong>：最小实现，只有检索与拼 Prompt，存在检索不准、上下文噪声、信息缺失、窗口溢出四类问题。</li>\n<li><strong>Advanced RAG</strong>：在检索前后加优化，预检索做查询转换（改写/扩展/分解），后检索做重排序与上下文压缩。</li>\n<li><strong>Modular RAG</strong>：把查询、检索、重排、压缩、生成、验证拆成可独立替换的模块，便于迭代和维护。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一条主线是**「瓶颈在检索，不在生成」**：三代架构的加固方向都指向同一处——先把检索质量做对，再谈换更强的 LLM。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么是-rag\">什么是 RAG</h2><p>RAG（Retrieval-Augmented Generation，检索增强生成）通过在生成前检索相关文档，为 LLM 提供外部知识支持，从而减少幻觉并使回答基于事实。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    Q[&quot;用户问题&quot;] --&gt; R[&quot;检索器&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt; D[&quot;相关文档&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; P[&quot;组装 Prompt&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt; P&#10;    P --&gt; LLM[&quot;LLM 生成&quot;]&#10;    LLM --&gt; A[&quot;回答(带引用)&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    Q[\"用户问题\"] --&gt; R[\"检索器\"]\n    R --&gt; D[\"相关文档\"]\n    D --&gt; P[\"组装 Prompt\"]\n    Q --&gt; P\n    P --&gt; LLM[\"LLM 生成\"]\n    LLM --&gt; A[\"回答(带引用)\"]</pre><p>RAG 与其他方法的对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>知识更新</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>幻觉控制</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>直接提问 LLM</td>\n<td>依赖训练数据</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>通用知识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微调</td>\n<td>需重新训练</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>领域适配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RAG</td>\n<td>实时更新</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>知识密集型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RAG + 微调</td>\n<td>实时 + 领域</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>最强</td>\n<td>专业系统</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"naive-rag\">Naive RAG</h2><p>最基础的 RAG 架构包含索引、检索和生成三个阶段：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 离线索引&#10;        D[&quot;文档集&quot;] --&gt; C[&quot;分块&quot;]&#10;        C --&gt; E[&quot;嵌入&quot;]&#10;        E --&gt; S[&quot;存入向量数据库&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 在线查询&#10;        Q[&quot;用户问题&quot;] --&gt; QE[&quot;查询嵌入&quot;]&#10;        QE --&gt; Search[&quot;向量搜索&quot;]&#10;        S --&gt; Search&#10;        Search --&gt; TopK[&quot;Top-K 文档块&quot;]&#10;        TopK --&gt; Prompt[&quot;构建 Prompt&quot;]&#10;        Q --&gt; Prompt&#10;        Prompt --&gt; LLM[&quot;LLM&quot;]&#10;        LLM --&gt; Answer[&quot;回答&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 离线索引\n        D[\"文档集\"] --&gt; C[\"分块\"]\n        C --&gt; E[\"嵌入\"]\n        E --&gt; S[\"存入向量数据库\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 在线查询\n        Q[\"用户问题\"] --&gt; QE[\"查询嵌入\"]\n        QE --&gt; Search[\"向量搜索\"]\n        S --&gt; Search\n        Search --&gt; TopK[\"Top-K 文档块\"]\n        TopK --&gt; Prompt[\"构建 Prompt\"]\n        Q --&gt; Prompt\n        Prompt --&gt; LLM[\"LLM\"]\n        LLM --&gt; Answer[\"回答\"]\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def naive_rag(query, retriever, llm, top_k=3):&#10;    relevant_docs = retriever.search(query, top_k=top_k)&#10;&#10;    context = &quot;\\n\\n&quot;.join([doc.content for doc in relevant_docs])&#10;&#10;    prompt = f&quot;&quot;&quot;基于以下参考文档回答用户问题。如果文档中没有相关信息，请明确说明。&#10;&#10;参考文档：&#10;{context}&#10;&#10;用户问题：{query}&#10;&#10;回答：&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;&#10;    answer = llm.generate(prompt)&#10;    return answer&#10;&#10;print(&quot;Naive RAG 流程: 查询 → 检索 → 拼接 → 生成&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> naive_rag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(query, retriever, llm, top_k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    relevant_docs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> retriever.search(query, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">top_k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">top_k)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    context </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.join([doc.content </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> doc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> relevant_docs])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"基于以下参考文档回答用户问题。如果文档中没有相关信息，请明确说明。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">参考文档：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">context</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">用户问题：</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">query</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">回答：\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    answer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> llm.generate(prompt)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> answer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Naive RAG 流程: 查询 → 检索 → 拼接 → 生成\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Naive RAG 的常见问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>检索不准</td>\n<td>查询与文档语义不匹配</td>\n<td>回答不相关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上下文噪声</td>\n<td>检索到无关文档</td>\n<td>干扰生成质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信息缺失</td>\n<td>分块切断了关键信息</td>\n<td>回答不完整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上下文窗口溢出</td>\n<td>文档太多超出长度</td>\n<td>丢失信息</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"advanced-rag\">Advanced RAG</h2><p>Advanced RAG 针对 Naive RAG 的问题引入预检索和后检索优化：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    Q[&quot;用户问题&quot;] --&gt; QT[&quot;查询转换&lt;br/&gt;改写/扩展/分解&quot;]&#10;    QT --&gt; R[&quot;多路检索&lt;br/&gt;稠密+稀疏&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt; RR[&quot;重排序&lt;br/&gt;Reranker&quot;]&#10;    RR --&gt; F[&quot;过滤与压缩&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; P[&quot;构建 Prompt&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt; P&#10;    P --&gt; LLM[&quot;LLM 生成&quot;]&#10;    LLM --&gt; V[&quot;验证与引用&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    Q[\"用户问题\"] --&gt; QT[\"查询转换&lt;br/&gt;改写/扩展/分解\"]\n    QT --&gt; R[\"多路检索&lt;br/&gt;稠密+稀疏\"]\n    R --&gt; RR[\"重排序&lt;br/&gt;Reranker\"]\n    RR --&gt; F[\"过滤与压缩\"]\n    F --&gt; P[\"构建 Prompt\"]\n    Q --&gt; P\n    P --&gt; LLM[\"LLM 生成\"]\n    LLM --&gt; V[\"验证与引用\"]</pre><h3 id=\"查询转换\">查询转换</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"query_transform_strategies = {&#10;    &quot;查询改写&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;原始&quot;: &quot;transformer怎么工作的&quot;,&#10;        &quot;改写&quot;: &quot;Transformer 架构的工作原理是什么？它的核心组件有哪些？&quot;,&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;查询扩展&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;原始&quot;: &quot;LoRA 微调&quot;,&#10;        &quot;扩展&quot;: [&quot;LoRA 低秩适配微调方法&quot;, &quot;参数高效微调 PEFT 技术&quot;, &quot;QLoRA 量化微调&quot;],&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;查询分解&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;原始&quot;: &quot;比较 RAG 和微调的优缺点，以及各自适合什么场景&quot;,&#10;        &quot;子问题&quot;: [&quot;RAG 的优缺点是什么？&quot;, &quot;微调的优缺点是什么？&quot;, &quot;它们各自适合什么场景？&quot;],&#10;    },&#10;}&#10;&#10;for strategy, example in query_transform_strategies.items():&#10;    print(f&quot;策略: {strategy}&quot;)&#10;    for k, v in example.items():&#10;        print(f&quot;  {k}: {v}&quot;)&#10;    print()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">query_transform_strategies </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"查询改写\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"原始\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"transformer怎么工作的\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"改写\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Transformer 架构的工作原理是什么？它的核心组件有哪些？\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"查询扩展\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"原始\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"LoRA 微调\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"扩展\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"LoRA 低秩适配微调方法\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"参数高效微调 PEFT 技术\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"QLoRA 量化微调\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"查询分解\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"原始\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"比较 RAG 和微调的优缺点，以及各自适合什么场景\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"子问题\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RAG 的优缺点是什么？\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"微调的优缺点是什么？\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"它们各自适合什么场景？\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> strategy, example </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> query_transform_strategies.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"策略: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">strategy</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k, v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> example.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"  </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">k</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">v</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"重排序\">重排序</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# from sentence_transformers import CrossEncoder&#10;# reranker = CrossEncoder(&#39;BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3&#39;)&#10;&#10;def rerank_documents(query, documents, top_k=3):&#10;    pairs = [(query, doc) for doc in documents]&#10;    # scores = reranker.predict(pairs)&#10;    scores = [0.9, 0.3, 0.7, 0.1, 0.8]  # 示例分数&#10;    ranked = sorted(zip(documents, scores), key=lambda x: x[1], reverse=True)&#10;    return ranked[:top_k]&#10;&#10;docs = [&quot;Transformer 架构详解&quot;, &quot;今日股市行情&quot;, &quot;注意力机制原理&quot;, &quot;天气预报&quot;, &quot;BERT 预训练方法&quot;]&#10;results = rerank_documents(&quot;注意力机制&quot;, docs)&#10;for doc, score in results:&#10;    print(f&quot;  [{score:.2f}] {doc}