hr>\n<h2 id=\"modular-rag\">Modular RAG</h2><p>Modular RAG 将 RAG 系统分解为可独立替换和组合的模块：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 模块化 RAG&#10;        QM[&quot;查询模块&lt;br/&gt;改写/路由/分类&quot;]&#10;        RM[&quot;检索模块&lt;br/&gt;稠密/稀疏/混合&quot;]&#10;        RK[&quot;重排模块&lt;br/&gt;Cross-Encoder&quot;]&#10;        CM[&quot;压缩模块&lt;br/&gt;摘要/过滤&quot;]&#10;        GM[&quot;生成模块&lt;br/&gt;LLM + Prompt&quot;]&#10;        VM[&quot;验证模块&lt;br/&gt;事实核查&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    QM --&gt; RM --&gt; RK --&gt; CM --&gt; GM --&gt; VM\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 模块化 RAG\n        QM[\"查询模块&lt;br/&gt;改写/路由/分类\"]\n        RM[\"检索模块&lt;br/&gt;稠密/稀疏/混合\"]\n        RK[\"重排模块&lt;br/&gt;Cross-Encoder\"]\n        CM[\"压缩模块&lt;br/&gt;摘要/过滤\"]\n        GM[\"生成模块&lt;br/&gt;LLM + Prompt\"]\n        VM[\"验证模块&lt;br/&gt;事实核查\"]\n    end\n    QM --&gt; RM --&gt; RK --&gt; CM --&gt; GM --&gt; VM</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class ModularRAG:&#10;    def __init__(self, query_module, retriever, reranker, compressor, generator, verifier=None):&#10;        self.query_module = query_module&#10;        self.retriever = retriever&#10;        self.reranker = reranker&#10;        self.compressor = compressor&#10;        self.generator = generator&#10;        self.verifier = verifier&#10;&#10;    def run(self, query):&#10;        transformed_query = self.query_module.transform(query)&#10;        candidates = self.retriever.search(transformed_query, top_k=20)&#10;        reranked = self.reranker.rerank(query, candidates, top_k=5)&#10;        compressed = self.compressor.compress(reranked)&#10;        answer = self.generator.generate(query, compressed)&#10;&#10;        if self.verifier:&#10;            answer = self.verifier.verify(answer, compressed)&#10;&#10;        return answer&#10;&#10;print(&quot;Modular RAG: 每个模块可独立升级和替换&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"backgrou