"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.generator </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> generator</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.verifier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> verifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, query):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        transformed_query </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.query_module.transform(query)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        candidates </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.retriever.search(transformed_query, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">top_k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        reranked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.reranker.rerank(query, candidates, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">top_k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        compressed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.compressor.compress(reranked)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        answer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.generator.generate(query, compressed)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.verifier:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            answer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.verifier.verify(answer, compressed)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> answer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Modular RAG: 每个模块可独立升级和替换\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"pipeline-设计最佳实践\">Pipeline 设计最佳实践</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>推荐实践</th>\n<th>常见错误</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分块</td>\n<td>语义分块 + 重叠</td>\n<td>固定长度硬切割</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌入</td>\n<td>查询和文档使用相同模型</td>\n<td>混用不同嵌入模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检索</td>\n<td>混合检索（稠密+稀疏）</td>\n<td>仅用稠密检索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重排</td>\n<td>Cross-Encoder 重排</td>\n<td>跳过重排步骤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prompt</td>\n<td>包含引用标记</td>\n<td>无法溯源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评估</td>\n<td>端到端 + 组件级评估</td>\n<td>只看最终效果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> RAG 系统的性能瓶颈通常在检索环节，而非生成环节。投入更多精力优化分块、嵌入和检索策略，通常比更换更强的 LLM 更有效。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>RAG 通过检索外部文档为 LLM 提供知识支撑，有效减少幻觉。</li>\n<li>Naive RAG 存在检索不准、噪声干扰等问题，需要进阶优化。</li>\n<li>Advanced RAG 通过查询转换、重排序和上下文压缩显著提升效果。</li>\n<li>Modular RAG 将系统分解为可替换模块，便于迭代和维护。</li>\n<li>检索质量是 RAG 系统成败的关键，需要优先投入优化。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"RAG 架构","id":"rag-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是 RAG","id":"什么是-rag"},{"level":2,"text":"Naive RAG","id":"naive-rag"},{"level":2,"text":"Advanced RAG","id":"advanced-rag"},{"level":3,"text":"查询转换","id":"查询转换"},{"level":3,"text":"重排序","id":"重排序"},{"level":2,"text":"Modular RAG","id":"modular-rag"},{"level":2,"text":"Pipeline 设计最佳实践","id":"pipeline-设计最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"嵌入模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/rag-and-retrieval/embedding-models"},"next":{"title":"文档分块策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/rag-and-retrieval/chunking-strategies"}}